ion through the FIA’s update kit launched in June this year.&nbsp;<p>The kit, costing €7,500, comprises new front bumpers and ...</p><a href=\"https://www.autosport.com/wrc/news/skoda-considers-wrc-rally1-update-kit-for-2027/10877650/?utm_source=RSS&amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_campaign=RSS-ALL&amp;utm_term=News&amp;utm_content=uk\">Keep reading</a>","contentLength":405,"flags":null,"enclosureUrl":"https://cdn-1.motorsport.com/images/amp/6AlvMXGY/s6/robert-virves.jpg","enclosureMime":"","commentsUrl":null},{"title":"Opel and Citroen exit is not a betrayal of Formula E, but a major blow at the worst possible time","url":"https://www.autosport.com/formula-e/news/opel-and-citroen-exit-is-not-a-betrayal-of-formula-e-but-a-major-blow-at-the-worst-possible-time/10877649/?utm_source=RSS&utm_medium=referral&utm_campaign=RSS-ALL&utm_term=News&utm_content=uk","date":1795604690,"author":"","slug":"opel-and-citroen-exit-is-not-a-betrayal-of-formula-e-but-a-major-blow-at-the-worst-possible-time","guid":459,"unread":true,"content":"","contentLength":0,"flags":null,"enclosureUrl":"https://cdn-1.motorsport.com/images/amp/YWKA31DY/s6/citroen-racing-citroen-e-cx-2.jpg","enclosureMime":"","commentsUrl":null},{"title":"Browning reveals hardest aspect of maiden Super Formula season","url":"https://www.autosport.com/super-formula/news/luke-browning-reveals-hardest-aspect-of-maiden-super-formula-season/10877643/?utm_source=RSS&utm_medium=referral&utm_campaign=RSS-ALL&utm_term=News&utm_content=uk","date":1795603843,"author":"","slug":"browning-reveals-hardest-aspect-of-maiden-super-formula-season","guid":458,"unread":true,"content":"","contentLength":0,"flags":null,"enclosureUrl":"https://cdn-1.motorsport.com/images/amp/0ZqAezM6/s6/luke-browning-realize-kondo-ra.jpg","enclosureMime":"","commentsUrl":null},{"title":"Six ways Marquez outgunned Aprilia to the 2026 MotoGP title","url":"https://www.autosport.com/motogp/news/six-ways-marc-marquez-outgunned-aprilia-to-the-2026-motogp-title/108